{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission Briefing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Location</strong>: Skubalon IV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey notes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old Empire waste facility (type 3b; a midden-moon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy crystals present (zero-point tech; still active)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaimable resources estimated worth: <i>7 trillion kudos</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directives</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excavate the identified sites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power the facility using the crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver all resources requested by the Hub</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A factory game in reverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take complete products and strip them down into materials and resources. Juggle recipes that yield more items than you put in. Sort sushi-belts. Deal with the irredeemable waste and excess items somehow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No ordinary base layouts here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancients left free energy just laying around in   crystals, yay! But they emit energy beams that don't behave like your familiar set-and-forget electricity grid, boo!\u00a0At first glance the colorful beams don't seem to cross, but there's probably a way to engineer your way around that problem with some tricky optics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old-empire AI can help out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI trained on advanced ancient tech is potent and you'll need them to help with safe disassembly and classification of stuff.\u00a0They're also extra creative when in groups so delivering a bunch to your Hub to collaborate together will unlock a range of base upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Monolith</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft one of these to win the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722000?t=1770268881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722000/2bab7e98a29c0641c5a9db067f354a25c0da3b2d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770268881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722000/2ef354fbe4ca25034b8ac4b934c955225c33c0b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770268881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722000/2ef354fbe4ca25034b8ac4b934c955225c33c0b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770268881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4383300,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mission Briefing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Location</strong>: Skubalon IV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey notes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old Empire waste facility (type 3b; a midden-moon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy crystals present (zero-point tech; still active)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaimable resources estimated worth: <i>7 trillion kudos</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Directives</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excavate the identified sites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power the facility using the crystals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver all resources requested by the Hub</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A factory game in reverse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take complete products and strip them down into materials and resources. Juggle recipes that yield more items than you put in. Sort sushi-belts. Deal with the irredeemable waste and excess items somehow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No ordinary base layouts here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancients left free energy just laying around in   crystals, yay! But they emit energy beams that don't behave like your familiar set-and-forget electricity grid, boo!\u00a0At first glance the colorful beams don't seem to cross, but there's probably a way to engineer your way around that problem with some tricky optics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Old-empire AI can help out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI trained on advanced ancient tech is potent and you'll need them to help with safe disassembly and classification of stuff.\u00a0They're also extra creative when in groups so delivering a bunch to your Hub to collaborate together will unlock a range of base upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Monolith</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft one of these to win the game!</p>","developers":["Dorfl"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722000/7ffe7af5c432acb0221111f716a4056e6334acff/header.jpg?t=1770268881","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722000/1775691270/62c3a215271050f1f06fd806bca7ee63f14c0354/1750837066/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747275660","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722000/1775691270/62c3a215271050f1f06fd806bca7ee63f14c0354/1750837066/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747275660"